00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.822
I-Catrat iyimbangela evame kakhulu yobumpumputhe obulapheka emhlabeni jikelele.

2
00:00:10.822 --> 00:00:18.917
Kubalulekile ukukwazi ukuhlola isiguli futhi uqinisekise imbangela ye-carat eselaphekayo.

3
00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:24.155
Qala ngokubuza ukuthi i-cyclose yenziwe kancane kancane noma ngokuzumayo.

4
00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:31.774
Uma iso elilodwa noma womabili ethintekile, futhi uma kube khona ubuhlungu noma ukulungela.

5
00:00:31.774 --> 00:00:36.060
Okulandelayo, hlola i-acuity yokubuka yebanga futhi ku-A.

6
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:41.060
Sebenzisa imbobo yokungena ukuze uqiniseke ukuthi ukuntuleka kwezibuko akuyona imbangela.

7
00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.060
Bese ubheka izinhlamvu zeso.

8
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.060
Ingabe zimnyama, ziyindilinga futhi ziyalingana?

9
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.060
Ingabe bayasabela ekukhanyeni?

10
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:54.060
Uma unokukhanya okukhanyayo, hlola ukuthi inhlamvu yeso uyancisha yini.

11
00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:59.060
