12
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:04.060
Ngisho nase-cataract, inhlamvu yeso kufanele asabele ekukhanyeni.

13
00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:11.060
Hlola ingaphambili leso eduze kakhulu nge-acolyte noma ngedivayisi ethile.

14
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:17.060
Hlola ukuze uqiniseke ukuthi akukho okunye okungalungile ngeso, ikakhulukazi isibazi se-cornea.

15
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:24.060
Nge-acolyte, ungaphinda uhlole i-reflex ephuzi noma ye-reindefundal.

16
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.060
Esweni eline-cataract, kungaba namabala amnyama.

17
00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:32.380
Amapheshana alahlekile noma awekho ngokuphelele, abheke

18
00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.700
kumnyama noma kumhlophe ngisho nakumakhathakhatha avuthiwe.

19
00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.872
