20
00:01:41.872 --> 00:01:42.980
kube ezinye izizathu

21
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.020
ngenxa yokulahlekelwa umbono.

22
00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:50.500
Lokhu kwenzeka ikakhulukazi uma inhlamvu yeso engafinyeleli kahle ekukhanyeni.

23
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:56.100
Ukuhlolwa ngemuva kweso kuzosiza ukuvusa okungalungile.

24
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:02.220
Kungase kube nenkinga nge-optic nerve noma i-retina noma kokubili.

25
00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:08.144
I-nerve ingaba negebe elikhulu ngenxa ye-glaucoma noma ibhangqwe ukusuka

26
00:02:08.144 --> 00:02:10.260
ukulahlekelwa kokunikezwa kwegazi, ukucindezelwa

27
00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.620
