29
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:25.820
Kulokhu, ukuhlinzwa kwenhliziyo kungase kungathuthukisi umbono.

30
00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:33.100
Kafushane, lapho uhlola i-cataract, thatha umlando, i-visography yokuhlola, bheka

